rl":"https://api.github.com/users/driesvints/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/driesvints/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/driesvints/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2021-09-28T11:33:22Z","label":{"name":"needs more info","color":"fbca04"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework/issues/comments/930799146","html_url":"https://github.com/laravel/framework/issues/38817#issuecomment-930799146","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework/issues/38817","id":930799146,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAHMwOs43et4q","user":{"login":"JosephSilber","id":1403741,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDM3NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1403741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber","html_url":"https://github.com/JosephSilber","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-09-30T05:36:04Z","updated_at":"2021-09-30T05:40:14Z","body":"> I guess this works as expected\r\n\r\nIt does not. It's broken.\r\n\r\nYou can see the problem more easily with this piece of code:\r\n\r\n```php\r\n$items = LazyCollection::make(function () {\r\n    yield 1;\r\n    yield 2;\r\n    yield 3;\r\n});\r\n\r\n$items\r\n    ->unique()\r\n    ->tap(fn ($collection) => $collection->take(2)->eager())\r\n    ->dd(); // [3]\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat call to `take(2)->eager()` consumed the first 2 items, so the subsequent enumeration is missing that.\r\n\r\nThat's not expected. Separate enumerations should never affect each other.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI'll work on a fix.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework/issues/comments/930799146/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"JosephSilber","id":1403741,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDM3NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1403741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber","html_url":"https://github.com/JosephSilber","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JosephSilber/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":5385139624,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAHMwOs47aZ8MzwAAAAFA-rWo","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/laravel/framework/issues/events/5385139624","actor":{"login":"JosephSilber","id":1403741,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDM3NDE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1403741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://a